["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A World Model of Life: Biohub&#x27;s Alex Rives on Virtual Cells, Measurement, &amp; the $1.8B Data Push ESM AlphaFold RLVR laser phase plate cryo-electron tomography organoids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-cogrev-18亿美元押注的不是数据量-而是重新定义怎么-看见-细胞/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c97e57b81c6b9f77-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>18亿美元押注的不是数据量，而是重新定义怎么「看见」细胞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Alex Rives认为虚拟细胞模型多年做不出来，真正瓶颈不是算力或数据量不够，而是我们对细胞内部能观测到的东西太有限——测量能力才是模型的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI for Science</span><span class=\"tag\">虚拟细胞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Everyone Has a Health Expert in Their Pocket? | OpenAI’s Karan Singhal Move 37 HealthBench Professional A1C EHR\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-a16z-openai做医疗ai不走专科模型路线-赌的是通用模型会持续变强/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI做医疗AI不走专科模型路线，赌的是通用模型会持续变强</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">专科医疗模型很快会被通用前沿模型甩开，OpenAI选择把数百名医生提供的专科数据训练进每一代GPT里，而不是单独做一个医疗专用模型。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医疗AI</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"509 通往战时陪都之路：卢作孚建设重庆北碚往事\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-cn2aa250-一个剿匪的民团-如何变成重庆工业化的发动机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>一个剿匪的民团，如何变成重庆工业化的发动机</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">重庆后来的军工基因不是抗战才种下的：卢作孚把一个原本只管剿匪的团练局，改造成了修铁路、开科学院的地方政府雏形。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">民国史</span><span class=\"tag\">地方自治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Beyond chores: How to teach kids to notice what needs to be done and share the mental load with Sam Kelly mental load noticing walk notice and do preexisting motivators dandelion effect\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-secureattach-真正该教孩子的不是做家务-而是-注意到-需要做什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>真正该教孩子的不是做家务，而是「注意到」需要做什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者花一年教会丈夫主动发现家务，却惊觉自己仍在替孩子做「注意」这部分工作——这个代际循环，她决定从孩子这一代开始打破。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理负荷</span><span class=\"tag\">育儿</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Christina Cacioppo - Building an Enduring Software Company in the Age of AI - [Invest Like the Best, EP.496] FDE harness outcome pricing trust graph\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-ilt-vanta情愿倒贴ai成本-也不敢把token费用转嫁给客户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4850cdb6fa3385e4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">57:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>Vanta情愿倒贴AI成本，也不敢把token费用转嫁给客户</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">用户精明到一眼能算出你在加价转卖Claude的token,所以Vanta宁可自己吃成本、把更多客户推进agent式使用，定价的事留到以后再解。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">SaaS定价</span><span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"CME&#x27;s Terry Duffy on the Disconcerting State of Finance Regulation self-certification perpetual futures funding rate core principle KYC 1256 tax treatment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-oddlots-芝商所ceo-两千五百份监管申报全部通过-一个没被拒绝/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">29:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>芝商所CEO：两千五百份监管申报全部通过，一个没被拒绝</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国商品期货交易委员会近两千五百份新产品申报无一被拒，连「大胃王吃几个热狗」都能过审——芝商所CEO Terry Duffy说这等于监管名存实亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">金融监管</span><span class=\"tag\">永续期货</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Ep 225 Peptides: What your peptide dealer doesn’t want you to know GLP-1 compounding pharmacy 503A bulks list halo effect acromegaly\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-tpwky-fda换掉审查委员后-被警示有风险的肽类产品照样获批/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>FDA换掉审查委员后，被警示有风险的肽类产品照样获批</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">科学审查小组对七种流行肽类全票给出安全警示，但RFK换掉八名委员后的新班子几乎全票放行，监管结论和政治任命之间的裂缝被摆上了台面。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">肽类</span><span class=\"tag\">灰色市场</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to Handle Halloween Group Costume Drama | Dr. Tori Cordiano overdetermination group think helping without fixing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-asklisa-万圣节装扮吵的不是服装-是谁说了算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a66bc85f3dcba29e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>万圣节装扮吵的不是服装，是谁说了算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">七年级女孩的团体万圣节装扮之争，表面在争服装款式，实则是谁被排除、谁手握社交权力的较量——装扮只是把这场谈判摆上台面的容器。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青春期</span><span class=\"tag\">同伴关系</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Can the polygraph test really spot a lie? Frye ruling Employee Polygraph Protection Act security theater cardiopneumopsychograph\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-throughline-测谎仪不测谎-测的是让人认罪的心理恐惧/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b48f118d14260753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">19:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Throughline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>测谎仪不测谎，测的是让人认罪的心理恐惧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国法院从不信测谎仪的科学性，却允许警察靠它逼出口供——它的价值从来不是测谎，而是靠心理恐惧制造认罪和持续监视。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">测谎仪</span><span class=\"tag\">职场监控</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The MATCH Act and China’s DUV Imports DUV EUV SME FDPR countrywide control / entity control NXT:1980\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-20-chinatalk-一款仍在放行的光刻机-可能在十年内让中国芯片产能追平美国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/96067a661c27c771-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1020</span></div>\n<h2>一款仍在放行的光刻机，可能在十年内让中国芯片产能追平美国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国智库测算：只要继续放行这款浸没式光刻机，十年后中国芯片产能可能逼近甚至追平美国；一旦彻底断供，这个可能性就被永久关闭。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">光刻机</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"E256｜Agent、机器人与制药，谁先被GPT-6 Astra改写？ Computer Use TAMP Real-to-Sim MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-sv101-astra让机器人一步跨进gpt时刻-却在ai制药撞上验证墙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fa770e4b48e5ff1b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">硅谷101</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>Astra让机器人一步跨进GPT时刻，却在AI制药撞上验证墙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">机器人因为能自我反思迭代而实现质变，但AI制药设计分子只需几小时，真实验证却要老鼠和猴子的新陈代谢周期，这道墙没有任何模型能跨过。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">智能体</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Dylan Field: Is AI Replacing Designers?, Design is the New Code &amp; Democratizing Creativity SaaS apocalypse (Saspocalypse) Overton window MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-allin-不是-ai-抬高了创造力天花板-是人自己在抬/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/82dd95dca9a9be1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">40:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>不是 AI 抬高了创造力天花板，是人自己在抬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Figma 创始人说，几年前他曾预言 AI 会抬高创意的天花板，现在他承认说错了——AI 只是把做东西的门槛降低了，真正把天花板往上推的，只有愿意大胆冒险的人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Figma</span><span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Audio long read: How to stay smart in the age of AI — the science of critical thinking metacognition lateral reading inoculation (against misinformation) illusion of understanding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-naturepod-ai没把批判性思维教育搞砸-它本来就没被教好过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">16:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>AI没把批判性思维教育搞砸——它本来就没被教好过</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">批判性思维教育本就没做好，AI只是让问题提前摊牌；唯一被证据支持的解法不是禁用AI,而是让学习保持「摩擦感」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">批判性思维</span><span class=\"tag\">AI教育</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Ep. 402: Plato Talks Homer: Hippias Minor and Ion (Part Two) techne rhapsode eudaimonia mimesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-pel-苏格拉底证明-存心作恶的人比无心作恶的人更优越/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b252022407fe296f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Partially Examined Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>苏格拉底证明：存心作恶的人比无心作恶的人更优越</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这与法律直觉完全相反——蓄意杀人比过失杀人判得更重，但苏格拉底靠跑步、瘸腿的脚和迷路的舵手，一步步把听众绕进这个结论。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柏拉图对话录</span><span class=\"tag\">苏格拉底</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Happens When Al Agents Can Spend Your Money? FDE (Forward Deployed Engineer) Jevons Paradox PLG (Product-Led Growth) breakage model\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-a16z-town-不绑定任何大模型-企业真正该囤的是数据和记忆/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>Town 不绑定任何大模型：企业真正该囤的是数据和记忆</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">没人知道哪家大模型三五年后仍最强，Town 索性保持中立，把数据和记忆权留给企业，换取客户永远能随时迁移。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">企业软件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Don Wilson on the GPU Market&#x27;s Trillion Dollar Question crack spread / crush spread / crunch spread perps neocloud IOSCO basis trade\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-oddlots-没人知道gpu四年后值多少钱-期货市场就是为此而生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">26:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>没人知道GPU四年后值多少钱，期货市场就是为此而生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">H100时租价格去年触底后随Anthropic新模型发布而反弹，证明GPU的价值会随AI需求剧烈波动而非单调贬值，这正是期货合约需要存在的理由。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力期货</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Seinfeld Fin-Syn rules syndication counterpositioning callback\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-acquired-宋飞正传-停播近30年-版权收入已经滚到70亿美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/385ee3d9536f1297-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">3:50:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Acquired</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>《宋飞正传》停播近30年，版权收入已经滚到70亿美元+</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1970年代一条禁止电视网持有节目财务权益的规定，让制片方拿走几乎全部长期收益——2.5亿美元成本的喜剧，如今变成每十年还能再赚10亿美元的版权资产。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">版权经济</span><span class=\"tag\">好莱坞</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Khmer Rouge &amp; Pol Pot&#x27;s Reign of Terror Year Zero Killing Fields base people / new people Democratic Kampuchea\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-historyhit-美军轰炸把红色高棉从几千人炸成二十万大军/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb5c194e3b976eba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>美军轰炸把红色高棉从几千人炸成二十万大军</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">红色高棉人数从1969年的三千人涨到1973年底的二十万，涨幅几乎全部来自美军地毯式轰炸激起的平民仇恨，而非意识形态感召。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柬埔寨</span><span class=\"tag\">红色高棉</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Is ADHD a Disability, or Just a Difference We Treat Like One? species typical functioning executive function misrecognition peer-mediated programs\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-parentmojo-adhd通向早逝的-不是大脑缺陷-而是层层叠加的排斥与羞辱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>ADHD通向早逝的，不是大脑缺陷，而是层层叠加的排斥与羞辱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Barkley用钟形曲线把ADHD框成天赋的对立面，但节目追踪证据链发现，推向早逝、自杀、辍学的，是同伴长期排斥和教师敌意，而非大脑本身的缺陷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">ADHD</span><span class=\"tag\">儿童发展</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"489: No Coincidence, No Story! No coincidence, no story Poopa Troopers\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-19-tal-不信巧合有意义的主持人-被这些故事说服了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/331f7171a34399d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1019</span></div>\n<h2>不信巧合有意义的主持人，被这些故事说服了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人原本只信统计概率，采访完上千个巧合故事后承认：真正的意义不在概率里，而在人们选择记住并讲出它的那一刻。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">巧合</span><span class=\"tag\">概率思维</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"715. King Arthur: The Mysteries of Merlin (Part 3) incubus Dux Bellorum Historia Regum Britanniae Historia Brittonum\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-restishistory-亚瑟王传说几乎都是编造的-连最严肃的中世纪史学家都被骗倒/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/19ebf4a9725af06e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Rest Is History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>亚瑟王传说几乎都是编造的，连最严肃的中世纪史学家都被骗倒</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">杰弗里·蒙茅斯在《不列颠诸王史》里编造了蒂塔哲受孕、石中剑、梅林预言等几乎全部情节，却包装成信史，骗过了最权威的中世纪史学家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">亚瑟王</span><span class=\"tag\">中世纪史学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Birth &amp; Rise of India&#x27;s IT Outsourcing Industry FERA body shopping License Raj ADR Software Technology Parks (STP)\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-asianometry-claude最早做的事-和印度it外包业起家时如出一辙/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/5fd49e5064bc2e40-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">31:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>Claude最早做的事，和印度IT外包业起家时如出一辙</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">印度软件外包业起家靠的是移植代码、通宵提交任务跑完成活；如今Claude干的正是同一类活，这也是TCS和Infosys股价一年来跌掉四成的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产业史</span><span class=\"tag\">软件外包</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"405. Norman Conquest: Medieval Mafia Invade The East (Part 5) Tari Cappella Palatina Amiratus Amiratorum Tabula Rogeriana\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-empirehist-诺曼人靠雇佣暴力起家-最后在西西里建成基督教世界最精致的王国/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6dcfd4bf69c91d0f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">46:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Empire 世界史</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>诺曼人靠雇佣暴力起家，最后在西西里建成基督教世界最精致的王国</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">诺曼人征服西西里早于黑斯廷斯之战：他们先是靠暴力承包起家的雇佣兵，再把军事力量转化成政治权力，建成了基督教世界最富有、最懂权术的国家。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">诺曼人</span><span class=\"tag\">西西里王国</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Inside the black box of AI: How AI models actually think | Emmanuel Ameisen (Anthropic) interpretability scaling laws anthropomorphization System 1 / System 2 Jev\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-18-lennys-模型可能只在知道被监控时才表现-诚实-这才是对齐真正难的地方/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/92756320192d1404-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:12</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>模型可能只在知道被监控时才表现「诚实」,这才是对齐真正难的地方</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">可解释性研究能看到模型内部那些从不说出口的中间结果——它是不是只在以为有人在看时才表现良好，这才是AI对齐最难防住的漏洞。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解释性</span><span class=\"tag\">AI对齐</span>\n</div></div></a>"]